Package: fluxcast-repo
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Depends: python3
Maintainer: Illia Pukalov <illia@fluxcast.dev>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://fluxcast.dev
Description: FluxCast apt repository and signing key
 Points apt at apt.fluxcast.dev and installs the key the packages there are
 signed with. The right suite is chosen from this system's python3 version.
 .
 Installing this package does not install FluxCast. Afterwards run:
 sudo apt update && sudo apt install fluxcast
